1
00:00:00,339 --> 00:00:02,069
(Sheldon:)Although as I say this,

2
00:00:02,074 --> 00:00:04,404
(Sheldon:)that might not have been
what you were asking.

3
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:07,140
(Leonard:)You think they'll
still go on the trip?

4
00:00:07,146 --> 00:00:09,246
(Sheldon:)All I know is after the fight
I went to Emily's to smooth...

5
00:00:09,248 --> 00:00:12,218
(Leonard:)They're not going on the trip.
No.

6
00:00:13,552 --> 00:00:15,752
(Raj:)What is wrong with you?

7
00:00:15,754 --> 00:00:19,054
(Sheldon:)Look at him, caring about
what's wrong with me.

8
00:00:19,058 --> 00:00:21,728
(Sheldon:)That is some top-shelf empathy.

9
00:00:23,562 --> 00:00:26,062
(Sheldon:)Hey, well,
we should start a club.

10
00:00:26,065 --> 00:00:28,735
(Raj:)You went to Emily's
to apologize.

11
00:00:28,734 --> 00:00:31,264
(Raj:)And when you left,
she was crying.

12
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:32,640
(Sheldon:)That is true.

13
00:00:32,638 --> 00:00:35,368
(Sheldon:)Well, I suppose
I should apologize again.

14
00:00:35,374 --> 00:00:38,074
(all saying no)

15
00:00:38,077 --> 00:00:39,207
(Penny:)Is she okay?

16
00:00:39,211 --> 00:00:41,181
(Raj:)Yeah, I calmed her down.

17
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:43,510
(Raj:)But she's not going
to Vegas if he's going.

18
00:00:43,515 --> 00:00:45,445
(Howard:)Wait, that's an option?

19
00:00:45,451 --> 00:00:48,721
(Howard:)I didn't know that
was an option.

20
00:00:48,721 --> 00:00:50,051
(Sheldon:)Well, that is fine,
because I've decided

21
00:00:50,055 --> 00:00:51,485
(Sheldon:)that I won't be joining you.

22
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:53,720
(Sheldon:)I've realized that
the most genuine way

23
00:00:53,726 --> 00:00:55,996
(Sheldon:)to demonstrate the remorse
I feel is to let you

24
00:00:55,995 --> 00:00:59,025
(Sheldon:)have this weekend
to yourselves.

